OL,3,GNEWSACity anti-social behaviour order  
OL,4,Aset to be expanded                     
OL,6,FPowers to tackle anti-social behaviour 
OL,7,Fin Leicester city centre are set to be 
OL,8,Fexpanded into nearby residential areas 
OL,9,Ffollowing complaints the issue has made
OL,10,Flife more "unsafe and less enjoyable". 
OL,12,FThe authority introduced a PSPO in the 
OL,13,Fcity centre in April 2025, which gave  
OL,14,Fwardens the power to issue #100 fines  
OL,15,Ffor behaviour including aggressive     
OL,16,Fbegging, street drinking and dangerous 
OL,17,Friding of electric bikes and scooters. 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
