OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACity anti-social behaviour order  
OL,4,Aset to be expanded                     
OL,6,FCity Mayor Sir Peter Soulsby is set to 
OL,7,Fapprove expanding the PSPO in the city 
OL,8,Fcentre to cover areas such as          
OL,9,FWestcotes, Frog Island, Belgrave,      
OL,10,FSpinney Hills and Highfields.          
OL,12,FSubject to a formal decision on 4      
OL,13,FDecember, the new order will take      
OL,14,Feffect from 1 January 2027.            
